# Optional server settings for backend-exp. Copy to `.env` at the repo root (never commit it).
# backend-exp reads backend-exp/.env first, then this file (first file with a key wins); see backend-exp/.env.example
# for every setting. Nothing here is needed for the dev build: users add their own keys in the app.
# Never put these in frontend config: anything passed to Flutter ships in the app binary.

# A server-wide key, only when the server should pay for calls itself (not the dev build).
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Required in production; development makes a random one per run.
# JWT_SECRET=
